                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c942035a-a8b6-33b7-875f-03f2b7b10321",
                        "entry_id": "737ab094-d790-3343-9db8-b7499b7e2355",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A bone containing edible marrow."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea6913a7-2a46-4a5d-b95f-4a8fe0bb9bea",
                                "sense_id": "c942035a-a8b6-33b7-875f-03f2b7b10321",
                                "text": "And thy skull and thy marrow-bones will I have away to Carcë, to my palace, to be a token unto all the world that I have been the bane of an hundredth great champion by my wrastling, and thou not least among them that I have slain in that exercise."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab819bea-9c67-38d8-8c2e-9db2ed858d74",
                        "entry_id": "737ab094-d790-3343-9db8-b7499b7e2355",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The shins or knees, chiefly in references to kneeling."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "humorous",
                            "in-plural"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a0b52cb-9f29-4c32-a581-7690ba206c48",
                                "sense_id": "ab819bea-9c67-38d8-8c2e-9db2ed858d74",
                                "text": "Upon this condescension, the culprit was called up stairs^([sic]), and made acquainted with the mitigation of his fate; upon which he said, he would down on his marrow-bones to his own master, but would be damn'd before he would ask pardon of e'er a Frenchman in Christendom."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb5cce34-3b8f-40c9-9528-9ce932310bb7",
                                "sense_id": "ab819bea-9c67-38d8-8c2e-9db2ed858d74",
                                "text": "So the news of the split between the old and the young one caused plenty of conversation, you may be sure; and will Mr. Robert go down on his marrowbones? and what has he done? was all the question."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02965b93-d857-4066-9c8d-855452f231c0",
                                "sense_id": "ab819bea-9c67-38d8-8c2e-9db2ed858d74",
                                "text": "They would all to a man have gone down on their marrowbones to him."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
